    "content": {
      "rendered": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"14270\" class=\"elementor elementor-14270\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3e22e8f e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"3e22e8f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9120a37 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"9120a37\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-da52c26 eael_liquid_glass-effect1 eael_liquid_glass_shadow-effect1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"da52c26\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">July 2026 Newsletter</h1>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-21fff68 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"21fff68\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-42e32b7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"42e32b7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"widget-content\"><p>Summer is here, and so is another chance to gather around stories of God&#8217;s goodness. This month&#8217;s newsletter is filled with testimonies that remind us how faithful He has been—through seasons of uncertainty, miraculous healing, and even unexpected turns on the mission field.</p><p>Whether you&#8217;ve been part of our Connect family for decades or you&#8217;re just discovering us, we hope these pages encourage your heart. God is at work. And you&#8217;re part of the story.</p></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b7f8819 elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"b7f8819\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c6e26b8 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"c6e26b8\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-69eba3d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"69eba3d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Browse the newsletter</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-05e2a9b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"05e2a9b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"widget-content\"><p>Take a few moments to flip through this month&#8217;s issue. You&#8217;ll find personal testimonies, reflections on God&#8217;s provision, and glimpses of what He&#8217;s doing through missions—near and far.</p></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-16a02a9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-shortcode\" data-id=\"16a02a9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"shortcode.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-shortcode\"><div class=\"_df_book df-lite\" id=\"df_14236\"  _slug=\"mpcbc-newsletter-202607\" data-title=\"mpcbc-newsletter-202607\" wpoptions=\"true\" thumbtype=\"\" ></div><script class=\"df-shortcode-script\" nowprocket type=\"application/javascript\">window.option_df_14236 = {\"outline\":[],\"autoEnableOutline\":\"false\",\"autoEnableThumbnail\":\"false\",\"overwritePDFOutline\":\"false\",\"direction\":\"1\",\"pageSize\":\"0\",\"source\":\"https:\\/\\/mpcbc.net\\/english\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/07\\/MPCBC-Jul-2026-Newsletter-FINAL-V3.pdf\",\"wpOptions\":\"true\"}; if(window.DFLIP && window.DFLIP.parseBooks){window.DFLIP.parseBooks();}</script></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-92c9cb7 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"92c9cb7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-791b21e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"791b21e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e7ad8e2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"e7ad8e2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Want to save a copy?</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dc2487f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"dc2487f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"widget-content\"><p>Download the full newsletter to read later, share with a friend, or print for someone who might need a little encouragement today.</p></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9202cf5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"9202cf5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https://mpcbc.net/english/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/MPCBC-Jul-2026-Newsletter-FINAL-V3.pdf\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fas fa-file-pdf\"></i>\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Download July 2026 Newsletter</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0718d50 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"0718d50\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-efdb019 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"efdb019\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">What's Inside This Issue</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-65169c1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"65169c1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"widget-content\"><ul><li><strong>A Personal Testimony of Faith</strong> – One member shares how the message of John 9 changed everything—and how God&#8217;s grace carried her through seasons of struggle and job loss</li><li><strong>Miracles in the Midst of Hardship</strong> – Stories of God&#8217;s provision through unemployment, a serious car accident, and unexpected healing</li><li><strong>Missions Adventures in Mongolia and Hong Kong</strong> – From car accidents to last-minute plan changes, see how God showed up in amazing ways on the mission field</li><li><strong>Trusting God Through the Unknowns</strong> – Reflections on tithing, faith, and the faithfulness of a God who never stops providing</li></ul></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-da6e1a3 elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"da6e1a3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e89039f e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"e89039f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d8c5ab4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"d8c5ab4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">A Glimpse of God's Faithfulness</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-02929ec elementor-blockquote--skin-boxed elementor-widget elementor-widget-blockquote\" data-id=\"02929ec\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"blockquote.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<blockquote class=\"elementor-blockquote\">\n\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-blockquote__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\"We were never without provisions. We had a home, we had food, and we were never without money. We kept two homes afloat, purchased plane tickets for visiting—but we made it a point to constantly tithe, for God would provide. And God continued to provide.\"\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-faf555d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"faf555d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"widget-content\"><p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">This is just one of the powerful stories you&#8217;ll find inside. Real people. Real faith. A very real God.</p></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t",
      "protected": false
    },
    "excerpt": {
      "rendered": "<p>Read the July 2026 newsletter from Connect Ministry in Alhambra. Discover faith stories, missions testimonials, and how God is moving in our church family this summer.</p>\n",
      "protected": false
    },
