  {
    "id": 12594,
    "date": "2020-06-21T06:00:00",
    "date_gmt": "2020-06-21T06:00:00",
    "guid": {
      "rendered": "http://mpcbc.net/english/?p=12594"
    },
    "modified": "2020-06-20T21:46:27",
    "modified_gmt": "2020-06-20T21:46:27",
    "slug": "how-to-wise-up",
    "status": "publish",
    "type": "post",
    "link": "https://mpcbc.net/english/how-to-wise-up/",
    "title": {
      "rendered": "How to Wise Up"
    },
    "content": {
      "rendered": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">During days such as these, it is important to find one&#8217;s &#8220;foundation.&#8221; Question, <em>What is it in your life life that really GROUNDS you as a person?</em> I believe we need grounding not just in slogans, opinions nor certainly any political rhetoric. We REALLY need rock-solid convictions from above found in GOD&#8217;S wisdom. Wisdom is what the Book of Proverbs is all about. We are beginning a new 8 week series on this precious book of the Bible. God&#8217;s practical wisdom beings all kinds of benefits to life. </p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Join us for worship on Sunday, 6/21/2020 at 11:00 PM Pacific Time  as I preach the sermon, <strong>&#8220;HOW TO WISE UP.&#8221;</strong></p>\n<div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a href=\"http://mpcbc.net/english/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/1ProverbsOutline.pdf\">1ProverbsOutline</a><a href=\"http://mpcbc.net/english/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/1ProverbsOutline.pdf\" class=\"wp-block-file__button\" download>Download</a></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a href=\"http://mpcbc.net/english/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Church-Bulletin-06-21-2020.pdf\">Church-Bulletin-06-21-2020</a><a href=\"http://mpcbc.net/english/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Church-Bulletin-06-21-2020.pdf\" class=\"wp-block-file__button\" download>Download</a></div>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed-youtube wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://youtu.be/6oW9y_CQ5yw\n</div>\n</figure>\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator\"/>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This sermon is proudly presented by CONNECT, a ministry of Monterey Park Chinese Baptist Church.</p>\n",
      "protected": false
    },
    "excerpt": {
      "rendered": "<p>During days such as these, it is important to find one&#8217;s &#8220;foundation.&#8221;  We REALLY need rock-solid convictions from above found in GOD&#8217;S wisdom. Wisdom is what the Book of Proverbs is all about.</p>\n",
      "protected": false
    },
